<title>UK: Graystone says has bid approach, shares up.</title>
<headline>Graystone says has bid approach, shares up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering and components distribution group Graystone Plc said on Wednesday it had received a possible bid approach.</p>
<p>Graystone said the approach might lead to an offer at a significant premium to the current market value. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Graystone shares were up 30-1/2p to 86p shortly after the announcement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
